Votal device agent rollout kit {{kit_id}}, fleet "{{fleet}}"

This kit contains an ENROLLMENT TOKEN. Anyone who has it can enroll a device
into the fleet "{{fleet}}" until {{expires}}, or until {{uses}} laptops have
used it.

It appears only in:
{{token_files}}

Once deployed, the token is in your MDM and readable on enrolled laptops.
Shield refuses an enrollment that claims the serial number of a laptop that is
still reporting, and raises an alert for it. For a stricter setup, upload your
MDM's serial number export in the portal, so only your own laptops can enroll.

To stop the token enrolling anything more:
  Votal portal > Enterprise Controls > Device DLP > Rollout kits > Revoke {{kit_id}}
Laptops it already enrolled keep working; revoke any of them on the same page.

Keep this kit like a password, and delete it once the files are uploaded.
